        "body": "Create or open a tab and choose its grid layout.Select the destination pane. Find the camera using search or the hierarchy.Add the camera and verify the image, name, and playback status. Remove, replace, or automatically fill cameras as needed.Clear the selection when you need to rebuild the layout. If a feed does not load, check connectivity, camera onboarding, stream URL, network access, and account permissions. To verify the workspace, deliberately replace one selected pane and check that the intended camera appears in that pane. Then switch away from the tab and return to inspect the retained arrangement. If a device cannot be found, ask an administrator to distinguish a missing camera entry, an incorrect group or location, and a restriction in the account’s resource scope. If the device is listed but has no image, investigate its stream and connectivity."
