        "body": "Use the Grid and Timeline controls at the upper right of Playback to change the view. Grid supports side-by-side recording review. Timeline places search matches along horizontal time nodes and displays details for the selected result. Timeline is a page view for search results. The recording timeline inside a player shows available footage and the playback position. Use the page view to compare matches over time and the player timeline to examine a recording."
